[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし。あとは魚がかかるのを待つだけだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right then. Now we just wait for the fish to bite."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "手慣れてるのね。ヴィクトルは釣りが得意なの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You seem quite experienced. Are you good at fishing, Viktor?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こうして拠点で生活するからには、仲間の食糧を\n調達しなければならないからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When living at an outpost like this, one must help provide food for their companions."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "自然と手慣れても来るというものだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You naturally become skilled with practice."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私も、姉様に美味しい魚を食べてもらいたいから\n……頑張る",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll do my best too... I want Alvina to enjoy some delicious fish."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、なんにせよしばらくは待ちってことで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I guess we're playing the waiting game for now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえねえ、その子かわいいっす！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, hey, that little one is so cute!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、でしょ？\u3000気に入ってるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, isn't it? I've grown quite fond of it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "生き物を身に着けるの、流行ってるのかなあ？\nフードに黄色いトゲトゲの生き物を入れてる子もいるし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is wearing creatures as accessories becoming a trend? I saw someone with a spiky yellow creature in their hood too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "黄色いトゲトゲ……？\n……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A yellow spiky creature...? Hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん、どうしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、そんな感じの生き物を、\nどこかで見たことがある気がして",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nothing, I just feel like I've seen a creature like that somewhere before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確か、アトリエの周りを散策している時だったかな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think it was when I was exploring around the atelier..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アトリエからまっすぐ南に進んで見つけた\n木の根元に巣を作っていたような……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If I remember right, I found it nesting at the base of a tree directly south of the atelier..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえー、そっちの世界にも似たような生き物が\nいるんだね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh wow, so there are similar creatures in your world too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにしても釣れんのう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still nothing biting though..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この際、ユミアのその銃で、バーンって\n撃ったほうが、手早く獲れるんじゃ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, wouldn't it be faster to just use Yumia's gun to go BAM and catch them that way?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうかな？\u3000……そうかも？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You think so? ...Maybe you're right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待ってくれ。大きな音を立てたら\n魚が逃げるだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold on. The loud noise would scare all the fish away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、そうですね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, good point..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねぇユミア。銃ってどうやって撃つの？\nアタシ、使ったことないから興味ある！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey Yumia, how do you shoot that gun? I've never used one before—I'm curious!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、撃ってみる？\n魚を驚かさないように、ちょっと離れたところで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Want to try? We can move a bit away so we don't startle the fish."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいの！？\u3000やったー！\u3000アルビが撃つ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really!? Awesome! Alvie's gonna shoot!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうやって構えて……足を開いて、肩はもう少し\n力を抜いて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold it like this... spread your feet, and relax your shoulders a bit more."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こ、こうかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "L-like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "撃ってみて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go ahead and shoot."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおおっ！\u3000当たった！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa! Did I hit it!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "初めてにしては上手いよ！\u3000筋がいいのかも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was great for your first time! You might have a natural talent for it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ホント！？\u3000スカッとするし、音もカッコいいね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really!? It feels so satisfying, and the sound is so cool!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、あんまり撃ちすぎると、離れたとはいえ魚が……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, if we shoot too much, even from here the fish might..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "半端に離れた場所で銃なんか撃ったせいで、\n魚が逃げただろう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks to your gunfire, even from that distance, you've scared away all the fish!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも、ご飯が無くなるわよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two realize this means no dinner, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんなさい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're sorry..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ふたり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Both"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]